cla_mmrs: give the encodings of the EAP event selects and relation

LogicalOp, EventType0-2 and Udf named their purpose but gave no encoding,
so software had to sweep them to find a relation that fires. The fields
now state the LogicalOp codes (0 OR, 1 AND, 2 Udf truth table, 3 NOR of
events 0 and 1), the Udf indexing by {event2, event1, event0}, and the
event-bus index of every event the EventType selects can name.

Recorded as a patch so the hand-mirrored upstream/ tree stays
reproducible from the vendored spec plus patches/ applied in order.
